、容姿端麗、基本的には何でもソツなくこなす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の信念に基づいて動き、思い立ったら即行動に移す猪突猛進タイプで、非常にパワフルな女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アルコールに弱く、酔っぱらうと絡み酒になり、終いには泣き上戸になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親は彼女が幼い頃に死去。仕事人間の父親は、その母の死に目にも立ち会わなかった。そのため、父親を嫌悪している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14403","sourceWorkId":"13049","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"2年A組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本有数の資産家の娘で、キュアメイトクラブの設立者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭脳明晰、容姿端麗、基本的にはなんでもできる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"猪突猛進で、自分の思いや信念に忠実で、そのために周りを巻き込むのも厭わない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、敵も少なくはないが、凛とした態度で臨む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思い立ったが吉日的な行動力は目を見張るものがあり、しかもそれをやり抜くパワーの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ようこそ、キュアメイトクラブへ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63654"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"78 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14403","sourceWorkId":"13049","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"b","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14403","sourceWorkId":"13049","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"153 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14403","sourceWorkId":"13049","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14403","sourceWorkId":"13049","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14403","sourceWorkId":"13049","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"45 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14403","sourceWorkId":"13049","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/082820bed86e3b578a2cd7f78377c80837e269f4a83c613a41b42f8cea816784.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/551c313fd6